  "title": "Grilled S'mores Ice Cream Sandwiches from Reynolds Wrap®",
  "description": "Chocolate is melted over graham crackers on the grill and then finished with a big scoop of ice cream to make these delicious s'mores ice cream sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
